and space and then there are the strange horrors&nbsp;
that are viruses hunting everyone else not even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:29.920
alive they are the tiniest most abundant and&nbsp;
deadliest beings on earth killing trillions every&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:38.160
day not interested in resources only in living&nbsp;
things to take over also we thought turns out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:45.920
there are giant viruses that blur the line between&nbsp;
life and death and other viruses hunting them

00:00:54.960 --> 00:01:00.640
considerably smaller than your cells or even&nbsp;
bacteria viruses are nothing but a hull a tiny&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:07.520
bit of genetic material and a few proteins no&nbsp;
metabolism no way to propel themselves no will&nbsp;&nbsp;

